<title>SWEDEN: Average rate 4.071 pct on Swedish 7-day T-bill.</title>
<headline>Average rate 4.071 pct on Swedish 7-day T-bill.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average rate on an auction of seven-day treasury bills was 4.071 percent, Sweden's National Debt Office said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The office said it served all of the bills at the highest rate. The paper runs from May 28 to June 4.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1003</p>
</text>
